sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Pipeline Orchestrator
    participant DH as Data Handler
    participant ST as Supervised Team
    participant AT as Anomaly Team
    participant AG as Decision Aggregator
    participant REG as Champion Registry

    O->>DH: Initialize Data Foundation
    DH-->>O: SQL DB Ready & Scaled
    
    par Parallel Tournament
        O->>ST: Start Supervised Training (XGB/RF)
        ST-->>O: Return Model Metrics (AUC/Precision)
    and
        O->>AT: Start Anomaly Discovery (Clustering)
        AT-->>O: Return Reconstruction Errors (MSE)
    end

    O->>AG: Request Best Model Selection
    Note over AG: Aggregator ranks agents <br/>based on validation performance.
    
    AG->>REG: Save Inference Metadata (JSON)
    Note right of REG: Persistence: Models exported <br/>and registry updated.
    REG-->>O: Training Cycle Complete